What is Paper Tape?
Paper tape is a pressure-sensitive adhesive material with a paper backing, designed for sealing, packaging, masking, and labeling applications. Unlike traditional plastic tapes, paper tape offers complete biodegradability and recyclability while maintaining comparable adhesive performance. The market offers several specialized variants including kraft paper tape, masking tapes, water-activated tapes, and decorative craft tapes - each serving distinct industrial and commercial needs.

